        "original_id": "01add3e1-8171-5ab5-9de5-5eccf4c70ae4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Teams: Miami Dolphins\n- Seasons: 2008 Miami Dolphins season, 2015 Miami Dolphins season\n- Competitions: AFC East, NFL playoffs\n- Topics: season goals, division turnaround\n\nFacts:\n- In the 2008 Miami Dolphins season, the Miami Dolphins won the AFC East.\n- In the 2008 season, the Miami Dolphins became the first team in NFL history to win their division after having only one win in the previous season.\n- In the 2015 Miami Dolphins season, the Miami Dolphins aimed to improve on their 8-8 record from 2014.\n- In the 2015 season, the Miami Dolphins sought to return to the NFL playoffs for the first time in seven seasons.",
